WEBVTT

01:13.060 --> 01:18.620
[Meet Yourself]

01:19.020 --> 01:24.330
[Episode 40]

01:26.956 --> 01:29.346
A friend of mine introduced
me to a businessman

01:29.346 --> 01:30.985
who is doing handicraft export.

01:30.986 --> 01:32.835
I have an appointment with him
for tomorrow afternoon.

01:32.836 --> 01:34.706
After we send our stuff back tomorrow morning,

01:34.706 --> 01:35.905
you could come with me tomorrow afternoon.

01:35.906 --> 01:36.346
No.

01:36.346 --> 01:37.785
We can split up.

01:37.786 --> 01:39.905
A friend of mine who is
also my former colleague

01:39.906 --> 01:42.028
is now working on travel consulting.

01:42.029 --> 01:43.709
He can provide me with some resources
that we may leverage.

01:44.626 --> 01:45.666
Okay.

01:49.516 --> 01:50.516
What's wrong?

01:53.236 --> 01:54.266
What do you think of

01:54.266 --> 01:55.586
when you're looking at this clock?

01:57.986 --> 01:58.996
Time.

01:59.986 --> 02:00.906
I always feel that

02:00.906 --> 02:02.716
it is the embodiment of our hotel.

02:03.026 --> 02:05.396
I am a turning gear inside.

02:06.116 --> 02:09.306
Every part of this time
machine works together

02:09.546 --> 02:11.186
to maintain accurate timekeeping.

02:11.516 --> 02:12.516
Beautiful, isn't it?

02:15.266 --> 02:17.786
I only see time itself anyway.

02:18.956 --> 02:20.956
Because you are a customer.

02:22.546 --> 02:24.436
You are now a customer too.

02:26.266 --> 02:27.266
I am.

02:28.076 --> 02:29.076
Hongdou.

02:29.796 --> 02:30.706
Manager Liu.

02:30.706 --> 02:31.356
It's been a long time.

02:31.356 --> 02:32.546
Haven't seen you in a while.

02:32.546 --> 02:33.396
I heard you're back today.

02:33.396 --> 02:34.676
I was just wondering why I haven't seen you yet.

02:37.266 --> 02:38.956
Who's this?

02:39.146 --> 02:39.986
This is my boyfriend.

02:39.986 --> 02:41.636
He's my former colleague
from Housekeeping Department,

02:41.636 --> 02:42.636
Manager Liu.

02:42.796 --> 02:43.465
Nice to meet you.

02:43.466 --> 02:44.466
Nice to meet you.

02:45.546 --> 02:47.516
I'd better let you go,

02:47.706 --> 02:48.545
and I still have other work to do.

02:48.546 --> 02:50.145
If you need
anything, just call me.

02:50.146 --> 02:51.025
Okay, see you.

02:51.026 --> 02:52.026
See you.

02:56.236 --> 02:58.066
Why did he call
your name directly?

02:58.986 --> 03:00.355
He liked me.

03:00.356 --> 03:01.745
Really?

03:01.746 --> 03:03.516
I'm not down to office romance.

03:04.146 --> 03:06.436
You have so many rules!

03:13.546 --> 03:14.996
Why are there flowers here?

03:16.356 --> 03:17.956
Is it also a kind of turndown service?

03:22.426 --> 03:23.705
Manager Xu,

03:23.706 --> 03:26.515
you are always welcome home when you are free.

03:26.516 --> 03:31.556
Wish you and Mr. Xie
a happy love life.

03:32.706 --> 03:33.716
It's nice, isn't it?

03:43.196 --> 03:43.955
Take your time.

03:43.956 --> 03:44.465
Okay.

03:44.466 --> 03:46.026
Let me show you around.

03:46.396 --> 03:46.986
The kitchen and the dining room

03:46.986 --> 03:48.915
are on the first floor,

03:48.916 --> 03:50.116
as well as all the lounges.

03:50.116 --> 03:51.266
All the areas including the tea room

03:51.266 --> 03:52.585
are all for common use.

03:52.586 --> 03:55.265
However, you must clean up

03:55.266 --> 03:57.515
after you use the areas.

03:57.516 --> 04:00.115
Because the housekeeper
is only responsible for

04:00.116 --> 04:02.436
the cleaning of public areas.

04:02.956 --> 04:04.836
Here, your room is on the second floor.

04:05.266 --> 04:06.515
Be careful when you go upstairs.

04:06.516 --> 04:07.516
Okay.

04:10.266 --> 04:11.266
Be careful.

04:13.956 --> 04:14.956
Here we are.

04:21.636 --> 04:22.636
Hu,

04:22.786 --> 04:24.996
let me introduce you
to your new neighbors,

04:24.996 --> 04:26.026
Kitty and Gang.

04:26.026 --> 04:26.956
This is Hu.

04:26.956 --> 04:27.226
Hello.

04:27.226 --> 04:28.226
Nice to meet you, Hu.

04:29.026 --> 04:30.226
Come on in.

04:32.996 --> 04:33.996
Come.

04:34.786 --> 04:36.156
Just look around.

04:37.786 --> 04:38.666
What do you think?

04:38.666 --> 04:39.756
Excellent.

04:40.436 --> 04:42.956
If there are any
problems, you can tell me.

04:46.656 --> 04:49.776
[The path to freedom]

05:31.196 --> 05:33.346
They must be given
regular exposure to the sun.

05:34.266 --> 05:36.396
In this way, the
leaves can grow into

05:36.396 --> 05:38.106
that kind of vivid green later on.

05:39.226 --> 05:40.756
This is the process of photosynthesis.

05:40.996 --> 05:41.996
You know that, right?

05:53.396 --> 05:54.546
What's the matter?

05:57.396 --> 05:58.435
I don't feel good.

05:58.436 --> 05:59.586
What is ailing you?

06:00.786 --> 06:01.906
My heart is ailing me.

06:01.906 --> 06:03.316
Your heart?

06:04.666 --> 06:06.466
You drink, smoke and stay up late all day long.

06:06.466 --> 06:08.026
You had that coming.

06:08.706 --> 06:10.665
I don't want to judge you, Hu.

06:10.666 --> 06:13.225
Although we live
together and we can help

06:13.226 --> 06:14.555
and take care of each other,

06:14.556 --> 06:16.106
but we can't always be there for you.

06:16.436 --> 06:18.756
For example, no
matter who is sick

06:19.106 --> 06:20.196
we can go to the hospital

06:20.196 --> 06:21.705
and take care of him or her for a couple days.

06:21.706 --> 06:23.666
However, if you're seriously ill,

06:23.906 --> 06:25.146
your parents are the ones
to shoulder the burden.

06:25.146 --> 06:26.546
Is that what you want?

06:28.146 --> 06:29.556
Don't keep shaking your head.

06:29.556 --> 06:30.836
What's wrong with your heart exactly?

06:30.836 --> 06:32.196
Should you go to the hospital?

06:34.436 --> 06:35.436
Xiaochun,

06:40.636 --> 06:41.906
I want to go to Beijing.

06:44.666 --> 06:45.786
Then go.

06:47.266 --> 06:48.266
What now?

06:48.706 --> 06:49.836
You want me

06:50.346 --> 06:52.276
to lend you some money to buy a ticket?

06:53.396 --> 06:54.196
Don't you want to ask me

06:54.196 --> 06:55.906
why I wanna go to Beijing?

06:59.196 --> 07:00.196
No, I don't.

07:00.396 --> 07:01.226
I'm not your dad.

07:01.226 --> 07:02.396
I'm not your mom.

07:03.106 --> 07:04.156
You have

07:04.756 --> 07:06.465
no sense of humanity.

07:06.466 --> 07:08.226
Aren't we friends?

07:08.516 --> 07:10.195
The dog always chases its food.

07:10.196 --> 07:12.075
I know exactly what
you're thinking about.

07:12.076 --> 07:13.195
Who is the dog?

07:13.196 --> 07:13.876
Who is the dog?

07:13.876 --> 07:15.196
You're the dog.

07:15.466 --> 07:16.075
You...

07:16.076 --> 07:17.466
A man like a dog.

07:20.636 --> 07:21.785
Alright.

07:21.786 --> 07:23.515
Go if you want.

07:23.516 --> 07:25.516
Manjun is much older than you,

07:25.516 --> 07:27.345
but she still has the courage to start over

07:27.346 --> 07:29.196
You are so young. If you work hard,

07:29.436 --> 07:30.786
I think there are still opportunities for you.

07:30.786 --> 07:32.226
But I need to remind you

07:32.636 --> 07:33.836
that the cost of living in big cities

07:33.836 --> 07:36.145
is extremely high.

07:36.146 --> 07:37.666
It's not gonna work

07:37.666 --> 07:38.996
if you keep muddling along like this.

07:38.996 --> 07:39.996
Understood?

07:41.346 --> 07:42.956
What's more, You
need to know that

07:42.956 --> 07:44.106
even if you go there,

07:44.706 --> 07:46.705
you shouldn't get your hopes up.

07:46.706 --> 07:47.906
You should let nature take its course

07:47.906 --> 07:49.466
when it comes to love.

07:52.876 --> 07:53.585
Okay.

07:53.586 --> 07:54.636
Then that's the deal.

07:54.636 --> 07:55.586
If you don't renew your lease,

07:55.586 --> 07:56.636
the lease on your room

07:56.636 --> 07:57.905
ends at the end of this month.

07:57.906 --> 07:59.346
Then I'll put the rental advertisement online

07:59.346 --> 08:00.555
ten days in advance.

08:00.556 --> 08:02.706
Well, I... I haven't
decided yet.

08:02.706 --> 08:03.906
Then think about it for a few more days.

08:03.906 --> 08:04.785
No problem.

08:04.786 --> 08:07.075
Anyway, if you check
out on short notice,

08:07.076 --> 08:09.076
I won't refund the deposit.

08:09.556 --> 08:14.025
You are such a heartless woman.

08:14.026 --> 08:15.346
Am I heartless?

08:18.056 --> 08:24.076
[The path to freedom]

08:24.436 --> 08:25.785
My girl is so pretty.

08:25.786 --> 08:27.996
Daddy's gonna wear
your hair in a nice braid.

08:29.706 --> 08:30.706
Mommy!

08:32.226 --> 08:33.396
What brings you here today?

08:33.956 --> 08:35.906
Daddy picked me up today.

08:36.746 --> 08:38.195
I was delivering goods

08:38.196 --> 08:39.345
to the customers close by,

08:39.346 --> 08:41.156
so I stopped by to see Hulu.

08:41.506 --> 08:42.985
I called your mother,

08:42.986 --> 08:44.356
and she asked me to pick her up.

08:45.346 --> 08:47.236
I'll sleep in the town hostel tonight.

08:51.556 --> 08:52.955
I'll go cook then.

08:52.956 --> 08:53.836
There is not much food at home anyway.

08:53.836 --> 08:55.116
I'll just cook a simple meal.

08:55.556 --> 08:56.276
I won't have dinner here.

08:56.276 --> 08:57.276
I'll be gone in a minute.

08:58.586 --> 08:59.586
Why?

08:59.586 --> 09:00.746
Hulu missed you.

09:00.746 --> 09:01.746
Leave after dinner.

09:04.036 --> 09:05.036
Fine.

09:05.346 --> 09:06.436
Then I'll help you with it.

09:06.436 --> 09:07.436
Okay.

09:20.076 --> 09:21.076
Luo Quan,

09:22.386 --> 09:25.076
your mother called me
and said that your father

09:25.076 --> 09:26.666
hit you pretty hard last time.

09:27.156 --> 09:28.156
Are you okay now?

09:28.706 --> 09:30.236
I'm fine now.

09:32.506 --> 09:33.956
I heard that you had a
blind date some time ago.

09:33.956 --> 09:35.026
How's that girl?

09:43.436 --> 09:45.996
We have known each other for so many years,

09:46.346 --> 09:47.946
so you should know me quite well.

09:48.466 --> 09:51.396
I am such a hot-tempered person.

09:51.586 --> 09:53.436
Sometimes, I don't
use my brain when I talk,

09:53.436 --> 09:54.675
so I might not talk properly.

09:54.676 --> 09:57.275
I also have certain
defects in my personality.

09:57.276 --> 09:58.906
So it's not all your fault

09:59.196 --> 10:00.505
that we divorced.

10:00.506 --> 10:02.186
I also have my problem.

10:04.586 --> 10:05.586
What's more,

10:05.796 --> 10:07.036
don't take anything

10:07.036 --> 10:08.546
I said to you before seriously.

10:08.746 --> 10:10.356
In fact, I know very well in my heart

10:11.346 --> 10:12.155
that you are not a person

10:12.156 --> 10:13.876
who does not work hard.

10:14.106 --> 10:17.985
I know that the reason
you sold water purifiers

10:17.986 --> 10:20.386
and drank with customers
is to make more money

10:20.386 --> 10:22.356
for the family.

10:23.746 --> 10:26.596
I was too young.

10:26.956 --> 10:28.516
After we had a child,

10:28.836 --> 10:31.236
I felt that our life became a mess.

10:31.626 --> 10:32.586
At that time, we weren't

10:32.586 --> 10:34.505
mature enough to deal with the problem

10:34.506 --> 10:37.066
and we saw things
from a narrow perspective

10:37.436 --> 10:38.556
so we couldn't see the whole picture.

10:38.556 --> 10:39.556
Therefore,

10:40.076 --> 10:41.426
we lost control of our emotions.

10:41.866 --> 10:43.345
That's not true, Xiaochun.

10:43.346 --> 10:45.066
It was my fault.

10:47.156 --> 10:52.516
I promised you that when we got married,

10:52.956 --> 10:54.396
I would give you happiness.

10:54.626 --> 10:55.626
But...

10:55.986 --> 10:58.306
So we were just too
young and immature.

10:58.986 --> 11:01.826
Happiness can not
be given by others.

11:03.156 --> 11:04.156
After all,

11:05.196 --> 11:09.276
I always felt sorry for you.

11:09.586 --> 11:11.026
Don't say that, Luo Quan.

11:13.346 --> 11:15.116
I never regretted marrying you.

11:15.506 --> 11:17.596
And I never regretted giving birth to Hulu.

11:18.106 --> 11:19.506
Although we aren't a couple anymore,

11:19.506 --> 11:21.876
I think we're living our respective lives well.

11:22.586 --> 11:24.075
You need to stop saying sorry.

11:24.076 --> 11:25.985
I think we should
let go of the past

11:25.986 --> 11:27.026
and look ahead.

11:27.436 --> 11:28.436
Okay?

11:36.506 --> 11:37.506
Peel the beans.

11:47.466 --> 11:48.276
Fry this one first.

11:48.276 --> 11:49.476
Then put that one in it.

11:51.036 --> 11:51.915
Got it.

11:51.916 --> 11:53.026
You need to turn it over.

11:54.796 --> 11:55.346
Slightly.

11:55.346 --> 11:56.426
Yes. Slightly.

11:58.346 --> 11:59.036
Welcome back!

11:59.036 --> 12:00.036
Thanks!

12:00.466 --> 12:01.556
What are you cooking?

12:01.556 --> 12:02.385
It smells yummy.

12:02.386 --> 12:03.836
We are frying fish.

12:03.836 --> 12:05.236
Little fish.

12:05.746 --> 12:07.156
Aunt Gui is making something delicious.

12:07.156 --> 12:08.106
We've all eaten.

12:08.106 --> 12:10.195
Put your luggage
away and come to eat.

12:10.196 --> 12:10.586
Sure!

12:10.586 --> 12:10.796
Okay.

12:10.796 --> 12:11.915
Then we'll put our luggage away first.

12:11.916 --> 12:12.705
Okay.

12:12.706 --> 12:14.036
Nana, turn the fish over!

12:14.036 --> 12:15.306
It's gonna be burnt!

12:23.156 --> 12:24.956
Aunt Gui, you can
open a restaurant

12:24.956 --> 12:26.396
with your cooking skill.

12:27.506 --> 12:29.036
My cooking skill is not good enough

12:29.036 --> 12:30.745
to open a restaurant.

12:30.746 --> 12:32.985
I just cook with whatever
ingredients I have.

12:32.986 --> 12:34.105
Right, Nana?

12:34.106 --> 12:34.676
Yes.

12:34.676 --> 12:35.705
Don't be too humble.

12:35.706 --> 12:37.956
Aunt Hua has said that
if you open a restaurant,

12:37.956 --> 12:39.516
Galsang Flower Restaurant
will be out of business.

12:40.196 --> 12:41.505
Did you listen to what he said?

12:41.506 --> 12:42.906
Flattery has almost turned my head.

12:45.276 --> 12:47.306
By the way, Hu
is going to Beijing.

12:48.796 --> 12:49.796
Go to Beijing?

12:50.076 --> 12:53.516
Hu is going to
Beijing to look for love.

12:53.836 --> 12:55.625
I'm not gonna look for love.

12:55.626 --> 12:57.345
I'm gonna look for a job.

12:57.346 --> 12:58.226
Is it embarrassing to admit that

12:58.226 --> 13:00.155
you're gonna look for love?

13:00.156 --> 13:01.156
Right?

13:01.626 --> 13:02.786
That's it!

13:03.196 --> 13:04.745
As long as you have something to pursue.

13:04.746 --> 13:06.195
What about your job?

13:06.196 --> 13:07.276
I haven't found one yet.

13:07.506 --> 13:08.506
I plan to apply for a job

13:08.506 --> 13:11.275
in the production department
of a music company.

13:11.276 --> 13:12.076
I still wanna work on music.

13:12.076 --> 13:14.105
What if I can make an
album or something later?

13:14.106 --> 13:15.835
That would be great!

13:15.836 --> 13:17.465
You should have gone there 800 years ago.

13:17.466 --> 13:18.195
Lazybone.

13:18.196 --> 13:19.276
Screw you.

13:19.466 --> 13:21.036
800 years ago, I
guess I was a little bug

13:21.036 --> 13:22.356
in a stone crack.

13:22.676 --> 13:24.306
As an old saying goes,

13:24.556 --> 13:26.866
if you wanna plant a tree,

13:26.866 --> 13:27.676
you should do it 10 years in advance.

13:27.676 --> 13:30.236
Otherwise, you should do it right now.

13:31.796 --> 13:33.356
You shouldn't be called Hu Youyu.

13:33.796 --> 13:34.836
You should be called Hu Youli.

13:34.837 --> 13:35.916
("Youli" here means
knowing how to find excuses in Chinese.)

13:35.916 --> 13:38.345
In my opinion, Hu
Youli is a good name.

13:38.346 --> 13:39.906
I'm thinking about changing my name.

13:41.676 --> 13:42.676
By the way.

13:43.346 --> 13:47.225
Today is my last
day singing in the bar.

13:47.226 --> 13:47.956
I would like to invite you

13:47.956 --> 13:49.465
to enjoy my last show together.

13:49.466 --> 13:50.706
- What do you think?
- No problem.

13:51.586 --> 13:53.625
Mr. Xie and I can't go.

13:53.626 --> 13:55.436
A horse is going to give birth
at the stable today.

13:55.436 --> 13:56.625
We need to go to the stable.

13:56.626 --> 13:56.836
What?

13:56.836 --> 13:58.505
You need to accompany the horse during delivery?

13:58.506 --> 13:59.225
Not exactly.

13:59.226 --> 14:00.276
The baby pony is in an abnormal fetal position.

14:00.276 --> 14:01.276
I'm a little worried about it.

14:01.866 --> 14:03.076
Aunt Gui hasn't been to a bar before.

14:03.076 --> 14:04.156
Go feel the vibe with them.

14:04.436 --> 14:05.226
No. I'm not going.

14:05.226 --> 14:05.956
People like us

14:05.956 --> 14:07.225
are not suitable for places like bars.

14:07.226 --> 14:08.156
A bunch of crazy and indulgent people

14:08.156 --> 14:09.385
dance and shout wildly.

14:09.386 --> 14:10.745
I'm not going.

14:10.746 --> 14:12.155
There are no crazy people.

14:12.156 --> 14:12.915
No.

14:12.916 --> 14:15.076
Aunt Gui, the bar
Hu is working at

14:15.076 --> 14:16.105
is not a club.

14:16.106 --> 14:17.075
It's not noisy there.

14:17.076 --> 14:18.426
I won't go no matter what.

14:19.036 --> 14:19.866
You've never been there.

14:19.866 --> 14:20.586
Let's go together.

14:20.586 --> 14:21.276
No.

14:21.276 --> 14:22.996
I'm going to bed at nine o'clock.

14:23.226 --> 14:24.835
You should try it!

14:24.836 --> 14:26.196
Just grab a drink and you can leave.

14:26.196 --> 14:27.985
It won't take you long.

14:27.986 --> 14:29.396
No.

14:47.256 --> 14:51.556
♫ The rain falls into the window. ♫

14:51.836 --> 14:59.056
♫ My heart becomes moist as well
when the dampness mists over everything. ♫

15:00.436 --> 15:06.176
♫ Tell me how I can hide my heart purposely. ♫

15:06.536 --> 15:11.136
♫ But no one ever told me.
Only the rhythm of the falling rain answered. ♫

15:14.216 --> 15:21.736
♫ I rubbed slowly in the dim world. ♫

15:22.956 --> 15:25.276
It's so rude that these
people come here

15:25.276 --> 15:28.625
to drink and chat.

15:28.626 --> 15:30.276
They don't even listen to the singer.

15:30.916 --> 15:33.396
People can do whatever they want.

15:33.956 --> 15:36.156
It's not at a concert.

15:36.796 --> 15:39.226
In old days, when a girl
was singing on the stage,

15:39.226 --> 15:41.036
the audience would applaud for her.

15:41.036 --> 15:42.826
Stop talking about the old days.

15:43.196 --> 15:44.276
Yeah.

15:45.276 --> 15:47.985
The alcohol costs three
yuan in the supermarket.

15:47.986 --> 15:49.996
It should cost at least five yuan here.

15:50.226 --> 15:51.385
Think about it.

15:51.386 --> 15:53.036
If it's five yuan, how
can they make money?

15:53.036 --> 15:54.156
Look over there.

15:55.156 --> 15:56.476
18 yuan.

15:56.916 --> 15:57.916
18.

16:00.036 --> 16:01.626
The price was increased to 18 yuan

16:01.626 --> 16:03.306
after they were transferred here
from the market.

16:04.106 --> 16:05.596
How much does this cost?

16:05.916 --> 16:07.236
48 yuan.

16:08.226 --> 16:08.835
Take a look.

16:08.836 --> 16:11.915
A few grapes and
less than an apple

16:11.916 --> 16:12.996
cost 48 yuan.

16:13.346 --> 16:14.465
Way too expensive.

16:14.466 --> 16:15.556
You shouldn't think like this.

16:15.556 --> 16:17.276
They need to make money.

16:18.036 --> 16:19.186
Aunt Baopin.

16:19.436 --> 16:21.155
Don't worry about the money.

16:21.156 --> 16:23.105
It's Hu's treat today.

16:23.106 --> 16:24.946
All we need to do is having fun.

16:25.466 --> 16:26.435
That's right.

16:26.436 --> 16:27.436
So expensive.

16:27.626 --> 16:29.706
Xiaxia, stop playing
with your phone.

16:29.706 --> 16:31.356
This is very expensive. Eat.

16:31.626 --> 16:32.585
Stop playing with your phone.

16:32.586 --> 16:34.236
I'm replying to work messages.

16:36.556 --> 16:38.156
Where did you get the chicken feet?

16:38.386 --> 16:39.706
I brought it myself.

16:41.106 --> 16:41.985
Have one?

16:41.986 --> 16:43.036
Are you stupid?

16:43.036 --> 16:44.746
This costs 48 yuan but you don't wanna eat it.

16:44.746 --> 16:45.626
And you brought your own snack?

16:45.626 --> 16:46.746
Put it away.

16:46.746 --> 16:47.906
Eat this first.

16:49.736 --> 17:01.436
♫ If the rain pours down,
then I'll become an ocean. ♫

17:03.216 --> 17:11.156
♫ Wearing the light you give me,
I can fly with my wings again. ♫

17:12.906 --> 17:14.356
Excuse me, lady.

17:14.626 --> 17:16.156
May I add you on WeChat?

17:17.076 --> 17:18.076
Sorry.

17:18.386 --> 17:19.666
I have a boyfriend.

17:21.386 --> 17:22.386
Sorry.

17:28.906 --> 17:30.746
Are you dating?

17:31.666 --> 17:33.466
No. It's just an excuse.

17:34.866 --> 17:35.986
Baoping,

17:36.836 --> 17:37.946
I think Xiaxia is becoming

17:37.946 --> 17:39.865
more and more handsome now.

17:39.866 --> 17:42.836
I think he and Nana
can be a good match.

17:43.106 --> 17:44.995
Nana is older.

17:44.996 --> 17:48.076
But look at Xiaxia,
he's too young.

17:48.346 --> 17:49.466
They're not right for each other.

17:49.796 --> 17:51.756
A wife older than the husband

17:51.756 --> 17:53.106
ensures a richer life.

17:53.106 --> 17:53.906
They're not right for each other?

17:53.906 --> 17:55.556
I think they're goddamn
right, aren't they?

17:55.556 --> 17:57.075
Stop that. Okay?

17:57.076 --> 17:57.996
Xiaxia is too young.

17:57.996 --> 17:59.556
Look, his face flushed.

18:00.036 --> 18:01.075
Stop talking about it.

18:01.076 --> 18:02.266
It's not fun.

18:03.516 --> 18:04.516
Stop joking.

18:04.516 --> 18:06.156
My brother is embarrassed.

18:06.346 --> 18:07.346
Aunt Baoping,

18:07.626 --> 18:09.475
when Xiaxia gets married,

18:09.476 --> 18:11.746
I'll pay for a part of his bride price.

18:12.836 --> 18:13.836
Okay.

18:15.186 --> 18:15.945
Thanks.

18:15.946 --> 18:16.986
You're boring.

18:20.136 --> 18:32.136
♫ Wearing the light you give me,
I can fly with my wings again. ♫

18:46.346 --> 18:47.426
Bravo! Nice song!

18:47.426 --> 18:48.426
It's beautiful!

18:51.386 --> 18:52.995
Thanks.

18:52.996 --> 18:54.396
My dear friends,

18:54.666 --> 18:56.596
brothers and sisters.

18:57.906 --> 19:03.946
This is my last day singing here.

19:05.626 --> 19:06.836
The next song

19:08.426 --> 19:09.666
is written and composed by myself

19:10.556 --> 19:11.556
called Wind.

19:11.756 --> 19:12.836
The song is for all of you.

19:13.996 --> 19:16.116
I hope

19:16.756 --> 19:18.796
you can forget about your stressful life

19:19.516 --> 19:21.186
at the moment and relax.

19:47.236 --> 19:51.016
♫ I always aspire to be closer to the ideal. ♫

19:51.936 --> 19:56.136
♫ The more I long for it,
the more disoriented I become. ♫

19:56.656 --> 20:00.496
♫ You're in a mess, and I'm flurried. ♫

20:01.336 --> 20:08.136
♫ It is seeing everything,
but it doesn't tell anyone. ♫

20:08.356 --> 20:14.676
♫ Some stop, and some wander as always. ♫

20:15.316 --> 20:20.175
♫ If life is a house,
then the days we spend in it are windows. ♫

20:20.176 --> 20:26.576
♫ The distance can stretch deeper
and further in our vision. ♫

20:27.016 --> 20:33.656
♫ Let the wind blow away
the sadness on our faces. ♫

20:34.096 --> 20:38.775
♫ Only when your spirit is free
can you see the light. ♫

20:38.776 --> 20:43.615
♫ The stories we want are happening
right next to us. ♫

20:43.616 --> 20:45.736
♫ Every window. ♫

20:51.036 --> 20:52.606
♫ People ♫

21:02.836 --> 21:05.016
♫ are forgetful. ♫

21:09.836 --> 21:11.896
♫ People ♫

21:21.836 --> 21:23.936
♫ are forgetful. ♫

21:28.276 --> 21:29.396
Xu Hongdou.

21:33.836 --> 21:35.036
Doudou.

21:41.716 --> 21:43.116
Is the pony alright?

21:43.586 --> 21:44.706
It can stand up now.

21:46.036 --> 21:48.226
I told Uncle Zeqing
to go home and rest.

21:48.586 --> 21:49.586
Peng is coming here later.

21:49.586 --> 21:50.706
We shall go home as well.

21:53.996 --> 21:55.116
Wanna see the sunrise?

21:57.316 --> 21:58.706
Is it dawn yet?

22:00.426 --> 22:01.426
Get up.

22:08.476 --> 22:10.276
Put the blanket on.

22:10.276 --> 22:11.426
It's cold.

22:11.996 --> 22:12.995
I feel hot.

22:12.996 --> 22:14.396
It's cold outside.

22:15.186 --> 22:16.506
Let me help you put the shoes on.

22:20.276 --> 22:21.276
Come on.

22:39.936 --> 22:44.776
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

22:47.336 --> 22:52.416
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

22:54.836 --> 23:01.425
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

23:01.426 --> 23:02.506
Xie Zhiyao,

23:04.186 --> 23:06.836
don't you think the
sunrise has a kind of magic?

23:08.476 --> 23:10.186
Yesterday is yesterday.

23:10.796 --> 23:12.466
Tomorrow is tomorrow.

23:13.346 --> 23:16.596
But today is a unique
and brand new day.

23:16.996 --> 23:18.746
The sun rises for me,

23:19.516 --> 23:21.186
and everything can be solved.

23:24.076 --> 23:25.076
This is something

23:25.276 --> 23:27.116
that is engraved in human genes.

23:27.836 --> 23:30.556
Human ancestors
spent long nights

23:30.556 --> 23:31.946
in dark caves,

23:32.316 --> 23:33.396
and the sunrise

23:33.796 --> 23:35.266
was the best reward.

23:37.946 --> 23:42.036
The reward for the long night.

23:45.416 --> 23:51.656
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

23:53.076 --> 23:54.396
Why don't you say anything?

23:54.836 --> 23:55.906
What's on your mind?

23:58.516 --> 23:59.746
Nothing.

24:01.106 --> 24:03.036
What I want is on my side now.

24:08.796 --> 24:09.986
Xu Hongdou,

24:10.556 --> 24:13.396
you're such a sweet
talker full of rhetoric.

24:13.716 --> 24:15.385
You can not cajole me in the future.

24:15.386 --> 24:17.116
Of course, I'll cajole you.

24:17.426 --> 24:18.836
Are you gonna cajole me now?

24:18.836 --> 24:20.276
I'm telling you the truth now

24:20.276 --> 24:22.156
because I don't wanna lie to you in the future.

24:22.996 --> 24:26.076
I'll definitely cajole
you, lie to you,

24:27.316 --> 24:30.905
be narrow-minded,
selfish, jealous, and envious.

24:30.906 --> 24:31.715
Right?

24:31.716 --> 24:32.876
Weigh the pros and cons.

24:33.076 --> 24:35.145
Sway between loving you

24:35.146 --> 24:36.466
and wanting to strangle you.

24:36.906 --> 24:38.396
Because I am a human being.

24:38.626 --> 24:40.186
The weaknesses of human nature

24:40.186 --> 24:41.986
are evident in me.

24:43.996 --> 24:45.076
Xu Hongdou,

24:45.316 --> 24:46.666
why are you saying this?

24:47.036 --> 24:48.076
What's wrong?

24:48.276 --> 24:49.506
I mean

24:49.796 --> 24:51.346
why did you put your love for me

24:51.346 --> 24:53.186
in such a big paragraph.

24:55.186 --> 24:56.796
My love for you?

24:57.796 --> 24:58.796
You love me.

25:02.996 --> 25:04.316
You just want to hear

25:04.316 --> 25:06.266
what you want to hear, don't you?

25:08.316 --> 25:09.995
I am a human being too.

25:09.996 --> 25:12.426
I also have a lot of human weaknesses.

25:13.036 --> 25:14.426
Take your time to find them out.

25:17.886 --> 25:23.816
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

25:25.936 --> 25:28.206
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

25:29.666 --> 25:31.346
You have gum in your eye.

25:31.346 --> 25:32.596
Let me rub it away for you.

25:33.146 --> 25:34.146
What?

25:34.186 --> 25:35.666
Gum?

25:44.276 --> 25:45.396
I'm going back to catch up on my sleep.

25:46.516 --> 25:47.276
Really?

25:47.276 --> 25:48.186
Where's the gum?

25:48.186 --> 25:49.906
I've already rubbed it away for you.

25:50.796 --> 25:52.226
Really?

25:53.036 --> 25:54.475
I won't lie to you.

25:54.476 --> 25:56.426
I feel like you are lying to me.

26:05.336 --> 26:10.656
[A year later]

26:44.036 --> 26:47.896
[Do whatever you want.
I'll always have your back. From Xu Hongmi ]

26:55.016 --> 27:02.475
[Open.
Teatime: 2 p.m.- 4 p.m.]

27:02.476 --> 27:03.946
Boss, may I put the flower here?

27:03.946 --> 27:04.516
No.

27:04.516 --> 27:05.146
It'll get in the way.

27:05.146 --> 27:05.755
Put it here.

27:05.756 --> 27:06.756
Sure.

27:07.276 --> 27:09.076
Qin, we will have
guests coming soon.

27:09.076 --> 27:09.866
Let's go check the room.

27:09.866 --> 27:10.986
Okay.

27:15.556 --> 27:18.116
Hongdou, our first
guest is already dining.

27:19.796 --> 27:22.156
Morning, my first guest.

27:22.516 --> 27:23.706
Did you sleep well last night?

27:23.946 --> 27:25.076
I had a sound sleep last night.

27:25.076 --> 27:26.186
The pillow is exceptionally comfy.

27:26.186 --> 27:27.105
Is it?

27:27.106 --> 27:29.145
I specially bought you this neck pillow.

27:29.146 --> 27:30.636
What about the breakfast?

27:30.866 --> 27:32.426
I love the rice noodles.

27:34.626 --> 27:36.666
Shanshan, go get
some chili sauce

27:36.666 --> 27:37.715
for our customer.

27:37.716 --> 27:38.716
Okay.

27:38.866 --> 27:40.076
It's okay if you don't have it.

27:40.076 --> 27:41.555
We have everything here.

27:41.556 --> 27:43.666
If you need anything,
just tell the waitress.

27:43.866 --> 27:44.475
Thanks.

27:44.476 --> 27:45.666
I'll go check the room then.

27:45.996 --> 27:48.316
There's an important
customer coming later.

27:53.076 --> 27:53.625
Thank you.

27:53.626 --> 27:54.746
You're welcome.

27:57.836 --> 27:58.756
We have checked this room

27:58.756 --> 28:00.385
according to the procedure.

28:00.386 --> 28:01.275
There's no problem.

28:01.276 --> 28:02.476
There are absolutely no fingerprints

28:02.476 --> 28:04.266
on the glasses and faucets.

28:08.356 --> 28:14.025
♫ Do you ever feel alone?
Standing in the road. ♫

28:14.026 --> 28:17.296
♫ Don't know where to go. ♫

28:18.936 --> 28:24.575
♫ In the air my memories flow. Faces in a row. ♫

28:24.576 --> 28:27.756
♫ Take a long way home. ♫

28:28.436 --> 28:38.136
♫ But all of these remind me to believe
no one will stay or leave ♫

28:41.836 --> 28:42.865
Perfect.

28:42.866 --> 28:44.706
In the future,
we should all follow this standard.

28:44.906 --> 28:45.625
Got it.

28:45.626 --> 28:47.076
Let's go to the next room.

28:54.386 --> 28:55.075
Hello?

28:55.076 --> 28:56.426
You said you'll come after you get changed.

28:56.426 --> 28:57.636
What is taking you so long?

28:57.866 --> 29:00.116
I have no idea which
clothes I should wear.

29:00.386 --> 29:02.036
Haven't you decided yet?

29:02.556 --> 29:05.276
Do you think I should
dress more formal

29:05.276 --> 29:06.636
or more casual?

29:07.346 --> 29:09.466
Just wear what
you normally wear.

29:10.146 --> 29:12.116
Yao, take a look.

29:12.346 --> 29:14.185
Which one is better?

29:14.186 --> 29:16.076
They both suit you.

29:16.556 --> 29:18.796
Pick one for me.

29:21.386 --> 29:22.386
This one.

29:22.796 --> 29:23.796
Okay.

29:39.386 --> 29:40.715
Don't be nervous.

29:40.716 --> 29:42.076
Take it easy.

29:42.476 --> 29:43.475
I...I know.

29:43.476 --> 29:44.666
I...I'm not nervous.

29:47.796 --> 29:48.756
I forgot to tell my dad

29:48.756 --> 29:50.345
to clean up the stable at home.

29:50.346 --> 29:51.586
It's fine.

29:51.586 --> 29:53.156
It's totally fine.

29:57.906 --> 29:58.906
Not too bad?

30:06.906 --> 30:07.755
They're here!

30:07.756 --> 30:08.146
They're here!

30:08.146 --> 30:09.316
Mom! Dad!

30:09.716 --> 30:10.346
Sir. Madam. Nice to meet you.

30:10.346 --> 30:11.426
Welcome!

30:11.426 --> 30:13.186
You must be Yao.

30:13.866 --> 30:14.795
You look more handsome

30:14.796 --> 30:17.186
and charismatic than in the video.

30:17.186 --> 30:18.275
Good. Very good.

30:18.276 --> 30:20.396
She's always like this,
loving to see cute guys.

30:20.756 --> 30:21.276
This way.

30:21.276 --> 30:21.836
Let's walk while talking.

30:21.836 --> 30:22.475
Let's go.

30:22.476 --> 30:23.386
We shall put our luggage away later.

30:23.386 --> 30:25.276
After that, we're gonna
have a meal at Yao's.

30:25.276 --> 30:26.555
His whole family is waiting.

30:26.556 --> 30:27.476
Okay.

30:27.476 --> 30:27.996
Give it to me.

30:27.996 --> 30:29.156
Put it in the car

30:29.556 --> 30:30.555
We're not tired.

30:30.556 --> 30:31.385
We're so excited.

30:31.386 --> 30:32.386
Here.

30:32.866 --> 30:33.836
Thank you so much, young man.

30:33.836 --> 30:34.426
Don't mention it.

30:34.426 --> 30:35.186
Do you miss me?

30:35.186 --> 30:36.346
Of course.

30:36.346 --> 30:37.076
I can't miss you anymore.

30:37.076 --> 30:38.275
Be careful.

30:38.276 --> 30:39.276
Give it to me.

30:42.076 --> 30:43.035
Come on.

30:43.036 --> 30:44.076
Is there enough space?

30:44.076 --> 30:45.156
Yes.

30:45.386 --> 30:45.796
No problem.

30:45.796 --> 30:46.425
Get in the car.

30:46.426 --> 30:46.866
Okay.

30:46.866 --> 30:47.426
Get in.

30:47.426 --> 30:48.466
Come on. Get in.

30:48.906 --> 30:49.906
- Dad, get in the car.
- Okay.

31:04.476 --> 31:05.946
Siping, Lanzhi! They're here!

31:05.946 --> 31:07.035
Granny.

31:07.036 --> 31:08.345
Daddy. Auntie.

31:08.346 --> 31:09.836
Hongdou's mom and dad are here!

31:10.346 --> 31:11.706
There's a horse here!

31:13.276 --> 31:14.555
No rush. Take your time.

31:14.556 --> 31:14.756
Auntie!

31:14.756 --> 31:16.145
Hello, auntie!

31:16.146 --> 31:17.186
This is your wife.

31:17.186 --> 31:18.426
Hello, sir and madam.

31:19.556 --> 31:20.146
How's your trip?

31:20.146 --> 31:20.796
Good.

31:20.796 --> 31:23.076
Granny, I finally meet you.

31:23.076 --> 31:24.466
How have you been?

31:24.666 --> 31:25.906
I've been great!

31:25.906 --> 31:26.625
Look at these.

31:26.626 --> 31:28.385
You shouldn't have bought so many things.

31:28.386 --> 31:28.716
Come on.

31:28.716 --> 31:30.666
I brought some specialties
from my hometown for you.

31:30.866 --> 31:31.906
Come and sit inside

31:32.186 --> 31:33.226
Where's Yuan?

31:33.426 --> 31:34.386
He's about to have
the college entrance examinations.

31:34.386 --> 31:35.145
There's a horse.

31:35.146 --> 31:36.625
What a nice place!

31:36.626 --> 31:37.586
Fantastic.

31:37.586 --> 31:38.425
Do you drink?

31:38.426 --> 31:39.906
I seldom drink.

31:39.906 --> 31:41.186
Dou always restrains me.

31:41.186 --> 31:42.105
She won't let me drink.

31:42.106 --> 31:43.036
Forget about her.

31:43.036 --> 31:44.506
That's right. Forget about her.

31:47.386 --> 31:49.036
They really know how to socialize.

31:49.796 --> 31:50.756
What are we compared to them?

31:50.756 --> 31:51.756
What are we?

31:51.906 --> 31:53.466
An eunuch in the palace who meets his Majesty.

31:54.106 --> 31:55.106
Zha! ("Zha" means too bad.)

31:55.516 --> 31:57.185
An eunuch in the palace who meets his Majesty.

31:57.186 --> 31:57.945
It's "Zhe"!

31:57.946 --> 31:58.946
I say, Zha!

31:58.996 --> 31:59.386
Okay.

31:59.386 --> 32:00.596
Zha!

32:07.036 --> 32:08.036
Xiaxia.

32:08.516 --> 32:09.905
Aren't you supposed to be in the guesthouse?

32:09.906 --> 32:11.475
I came to get something.

32:11.476 --> 32:12.665
Where are you going?

32:12.666 --> 32:13.906
Go and take a look at your guesthouse.

32:14.146 --> 32:14.835
Sure.

32:14.836 --> 32:15.906
I'll buy you coffee.

32:21.476 --> 32:22.476
Nana.

32:23.186 --> 32:24.266
I'm leaving.

32:24.836 --> 32:25.905
Leaving?

32:25.906 --> 32:27.105
Where are you going?

32:27.106 --> 32:28.945
I'm going to a
wood-carving workshop

32:28.946 --> 32:30.116
to learn some crafts.

32:30.426 --> 32:31.905
Did you tell your master?

32:31.906 --> 32:32.555
Yes.

32:32.556 --> 32:33.836
He supported me.

32:34.316 --> 32:34.796
Besides,

32:34.796 --> 32:35.906
I still want to come back in the future.

32:36.586 --> 32:37.666
Good for you.

32:39.186 --> 32:40.386
Hearing this abruptly

32:40.386 --> 32:42.036
makes me feel that I have missed you already.

32:42.476 --> 32:44.555
We could often see each other before,

32:44.556 --> 32:46.156
but you're going far away all of a sudden.

32:46.796 --> 32:47.796
Really?

32:50.906 --> 32:52.876
Will you reply to my
messages if I text you?

32:53.076 --> 32:53.906
Of course, I will.

32:53.906 --> 32:55.356
How can I not reply to your message?

32:57.666 --> 32:58.836
Then you promise.

33:07.586 --> 33:08.636
Xiaxia,

33:10.146 --> 33:12.796
I have always treated you as my younger brother.

33:18.756 --> 33:19.756
I know.

33:20.106 --> 33:21.156
It's okay.

33:25.716 --> 33:26.276
Take good care of yourself

33:26.276 --> 33:27.555
after you go to Xiamen.

33:27.556 --> 33:28.556
I will.

33:33.836 --> 33:36.396
Whose cattle left so much dung here?

33:37.796 --> 33:40.156
It must have been a herd of cattle.

33:45.276 --> 33:47.226
I'm back again!

33:51.106 --> 33:52.116
Still the same.

33:52.556 --> 33:53.796
Nothing has changed.

33:56.276 --> 33:57.275
Look.

33:57.276 --> 33:58.586
The futon you meditated on

33:58.586 --> 33:59.666
hasn't been worn out yet.

33:59.866 --> 34:00.795
Sorry.

34:00.796 --> 34:01.796
This is a private residence.

34:01.796 --> 34:03.036
Visitors are not allowed to come in.

34:03.506 --> 34:04.385
Hello.

34:04.386 --> 34:05.795
We used to live here.

34:05.796 --> 34:06.956
So we wanna stop by.

34:07.276 --> 34:09.506
Gentlemen, you are not
allowed to walk around

34:09.506 --> 34:11.346
and take pictures here.

34:12.466 --> 34:14.516
Aunt Gui.

34:15.546 --> 34:17.666
Hu. Mr. Ma.

34:18.596 --> 34:19.426
How are you?

34:19.426 --> 34:20.276
I'm good.

34:20.276 --> 34:21.706
Good.

34:22.276 --> 34:23.675
I'm sorry for what happened just now.

34:23.676 --> 34:24.986
Now there are more tourists in the village

34:24.986 --> 34:26.826
and they come to take pictures every day.

34:27.676 --> 34:28.956
You're here to travel?

34:29.466 --> 34:32.345
Manager Xu's guesthouse
is having a soft launch.

34:32.346 --> 34:33.505
She reserved two rooms for us.

34:33.506 --> 34:34.466
So we decided to have a holiday here

34:34.466 --> 34:35.755
this weekend.

34:35.756 --> 34:37.436
Wonderful!

34:38.316 --> 34:39.276
How have you been?

34:39.276 --> 34:40.195
How's your work?

34:40.196 --> 34:40.946
Thanks for your blessing.

34:40.946 --> 34:41.956
I've been doing great.

34:42.196 --> 34:43.115
Me too.

34:43.116 --> 34:44.716
And Manjun is doing great.

34:44.716 --> 34:45.716
Good for you all!

34:45.716 --> 34:46.716
I'm happy for you.

34:47.026 --> 34:47.386
What about you?

34:47.386 --> 34:48.276
How are you doing?

34:48.276 --> 34:49.985
Of course, I'm doing good.

34:49.986 --> 34:52.155
In the spring,
I went for a physical examination,

34:52.156 --> 34:53.796
checking my stomach and intestines,
basically everything.

34:53.796 --> 34:55.345
And there's no problem at all.

34:55.346 --> 34:57.786
The doctor said
I'm even healthier

34:57.986 --> 34:59.996
than young people like you guys.

35:00.346 --> 35:01.276
Nothing is more important than health.

35:01.276 --> 35:02.945
Exactly. I totally agree.

35:02.946 --> 35:05.956
He is Hu, He used
to live in your room.

35:06.466 --> 35:07.476
Hello.

35:08.426 --> 35:10.516
How about we go to
the guesthouse first,

35:11.026 --> 35:12.065
and we'll let you crack on?

35:12.066 --> 35:12.635
Sure.

35:12.636 --> 35:14.115
I'll come to meet with you guys tonight.

35:14.116 --> 35:14.386
Of course.

35:14.386 --> 35:15.386
You must come.

35:16.156 --> 35:17.956
Take good care of that room.

35:20.716 --> 35:22.116
What are you rubbing?

35:22.756 --> 35:23.636
Is it dung?

35:23.636 --> 35:25.116
It's luck! (Stepping on cattle or dog dung
heralds upcoming luck in Chinese)

35:26.156 --> 35:26.986
I'll leave it here for you.

35:26.986 --> 35:28.156
Leave it here for you.

35:29.346 --> 35:29.676
Let's go.

35:29.676 --> 35:30.345
Okay.

35:30.346 --> 35:31.345
See you tonight.

35:31.346 --> 35:32.516
Okay. See you tonight.

35:32.716 --> 35:33.545
Mr. Ma.

35:33.546 --> 35:34.716
There has been a lot of publicity

35:34.716 --> 35:35.636
for your store.

35:35.636 --> 35:37.155
Are you gonna open a new branch?

35:37.156 --> 35:38.715
Blind optimism is inadvisable.

35:38.716 --> 35:41.835
Many tea stores entered
the market this year,

35:41.836 --> 35:43.865
but they were
all so similar that

35:43.866 --> 35:44.865
the market has become extremely competitive.

35:44.866 --> 35:46.156
Competitions are good.

35:46.156 --> 35:47.675
Competitions mean prospects.

35:47.676 --> 35:49.706
Everyone is going into the market.

35:50.316 --> 35:53.025
Hu, How are you and Manjun now?

35:53.026 --> 35:54.786
We are da-ting.

35:55.276 --> 35:55.985
Dating.

35:55.986 --> 35:56.865
Da-ting?

35:56.866 --> 35:58.156
Dating?

35:58.156 --> 35:59.505
Still dating?

35:59.506 --> 36:00.465
So what?

36:00.466 --> 36:01.156
What about you?

36:01.156 --> 36:02.155
Do you have a boyfriend now?

36:02.156 --> 36:02.796
What do you mean?

36:02.796 --> 36:04.795
Look down upon me, don't you?

36:04.796 --> 36:05.945
I'll tell you what.

36:05.946 --> 36:07.676
It is me who is not interested in them.

36:07.676 --> 36:08.756
It's not that nobody likes me.

36:08.756 --> 36:09.316
- Understand?
- I know that.

36:09.316 --> 36:11.596
I heard that there was
a man called Hui, right?

36:11.596 --> 36:13.116
That was like 800 years ago.

36:13.116 --> 36:15.116
He sent me an
invitation six months ago.

36:15.116 --> 36:17.025
I guess he might have a baby now.

36:17.026 --> 36:18.386
Stop joking about it.

36:19.986 --> 36:21.865
Hongdou, where are
your mom and dad?

36:21.866 --> 36:23.636
They're playing mahjong at Mr. Xie's.

36:24.986 --> 36:26.346
I'm gonna pop the champagne!

36:29.906 --> 36:30.906
Here.

36:31.116 --> 36:32.235
Let me serve you.

36:32.236 --> 36:33.505
Come on.

36:33.506 --> 36:35.076
Let's drink.

36:35.346 --> 36:36.426
Here you are.

36:36.426 --> 36:37.196
Awesome.

36:37.196 --> 36:38.115
Here.

36:38.116 --> 36:38.546
Thanks.

36:38.546 --> 36:39.546
Nothing.

36:41.066 --> 36:43.155
Are you guys ready now?

36:43.156 --> 36:45.385
Well, Manager Xu, say something!

36:45.386 --> 36:46.715
Applause!

36:46.716 --> 36:47.506
Everyone, applause!

36:47.506 --> 36:48.516
Say something!

36:49.276 --> 36:49.836
Say a lot!

36:49.836 --> 36:51.076
Alright.

36:51.836 --> 36:54.196
Today is the first
day of the soft launch

36:54.196 --> 36:56.065
of Soft Breeze Guesthouse.

36:56.066 --> 36:57.635
I would like to extend my sincere gratitude

36:57.636 --> 36:59.675
to my dear friends from all over the world

36:59.676 --> 37:02.155
who come to gather here

37:02.156 --> 37:05.116
and witness the new
chapter of my career.

37:10.196 --> 37:11.945
How time flies.

37:11.946 --> 37:13.516
A year has passed.

37:14.756 --> 37:16.675
I was not in a good mood

37:16.676 --> 37:18.226
when I first arrived here

37:19.066 --> 37:20.476
and met you guys.

37:21.596 --> 37:24.186
We all have our own troubles.

37:25.716 --> 37:27.266
Fortunately, we have all gotten through these.

37:30.676 --> 37:32.076
Seeing that

37:34.196 --> 37:36.505
your lives and everything

37:36.506 --> 37:37.956
are back on the right track,

37:40.066 --> 37:41.266
I feel really happy for you guys.

37:43.276 --> 37:44.276
Of course.

37:44.506 --> 37:46.076
I am truly thankful to my Mr. Xie.

37:48.426 --> 37:51.756
It was his Youfeng Yard
that gave people like us

37:51.756 --> 37:53.516
who are struggling in this world

37:54.026 --> 37:56.196
an opportunity and
a temporary space

37:56.196 --> 37:58.386
to have a break

37:59.906 --> 38:01.186
and get to know each other.

38:05.116 --> 38:11.376
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

38:17.066 --> 38:18.066
My gratitude for you all is in wine.

38:18.066 --> 38:18.596
Cheers!

38:18.596 --> 38:19.275
Come on!

38:19.276 --> 38:19.905
Come on!

38:19.906 --> 38:20.386
Everyone!

38:20.386 --> 38:21.595
Wait a moment!

38:21.596 --> 38:22.796
Old rules.

38:22.796 --> 38:24.906
Make a toast before drinking.

38:24.906 --> 38:25.985
I'll go first.

38:25.986 --> 38:30.275
May all your wishes come true.

38:30.276 --> 38:30.546
Great!

38:30.546 --> 38:33.076
I wish we can have
a year of harvest.

38:33.596 --> 38:34.946
Why? Isn't that a good wish?

38:34.946 --> 38:35.946
It is!

38:36.066 --> 38:37.275
I wish a world of everlasting peace

38:37.276 --> 38:38.275
and a prosperous China.

38:38.276 --> 38:38.945
Bravo!

38:38.946 --> 38:41.386
A peaceful world!

38:41.836 --> 38:43.186
A peaceful universe!

38:44.026 --> 38:44.635
We all make a fortune!

38:44.636 --> 38:45.426
Get rich!

38:45.426 --> 38:47.465
All shall be well!

38:47.466 --> 38:49.036
Every Jack has his Jill.

38:53.316 --> 38:55.865
Many happy returns of the day.

38:55.866 --> 38:57.636
Wish us happiness and prosperity.

38:57.636 --> 38:59.865
Bottoms up!

38:59.866 --> 39:01.235
Come on.

39:01.236 --> 39:03.225
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

39:03.226 --> 39:07.516
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

39:07.836 --> 39:14.016
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

39:14.596 --> 39:15.506
Have a try.

39:15.506 --> 39:16.605
I could smell the tantalizing aroma just now.

39:16.606 --> 39:22.256
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

39:22.586 --> 39:28.656
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

39:30.736 --> 39:32.746
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

39:33.636 --> 39:35.065
When are you going to Mount Huangshan

39:35.066 --> 39:36.426
to participate in

39:36.426 --> 39:37.706
the conference of B&B industry.

39:37.986 --> 39:38.996
On Friday.

39:39.986 --> 39:41.345
Then I'm afraid
I can't drive you to the airport.

39:41.346 --> 39:42.195
I have to go to Beijing on Thursday

39:42.196 --> 39:43.786
for some issues on collaboration.

39:44.506 --> 39:45.996
Then let's split up.

39:47.636 --> 39:48.905
Don't book a ticket for me.

39:48.906 --> 39:50.866
The expense should be reimbursed
by the corporate account.

39:51.596 --> 39:52.795
Okay.

39:52.796 --> 39:54.786
Play by the rules.

40:01.866 --> 40:03.156
So many stars.

40:07.196 --> 40:08.196
I wonder

40:09.276 --> 40:10.826
which one is your grandma,

40:11.196 --> 40:12.666
which one is Chen Nanxing,

40:13.836 --> 40:15.076
and which one

40:15.866 --> 40:17.186
is my mom.

40:22.426 --> 40:23.436
I don't know.

40:32.986 --> 40:33.986
Why?

40:35.636 --> 40:38.996
I wish time could
stop at this moment.

40:40.316 --> 40:41.346
At this moment

40:42.986 --> 40:43.946
I feel we are getting closer

40:43.946 --> 40:45.596
to the ultimate happiness.

40:47.756 --> 40:49.476
Then let time stop.

40:50.836 --> 40:52.186
Let's count three, two, one,

40:53.596 --> 40:54.905
and it can stop.

40:54.906 --> 40:56.116
Have a try.

40:56.716 --> 40:57.716
Try it.

41:00.946 --> 41:01.996
One.

41:02.276 --> 41:03.675
Two.

41:03.676 --> 41:04.676
Three.

41:09.326 --> 41:11.345
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

41:11.346 --> 41:15.676
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

41:15.927 --> 41:23.197
[Time will go on ceaselessly.
Happiness will never end.]

41:23.300 --> 41:32.968
[Dark clouds are temporary,
since there will always be wind.]

41:34.496 --> 41:40.006
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

41:41.936 --> 41:46.926
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

41:49.346 --> 41:55.436
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

41:55.716 --> 42:01.136
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

42:04.056 --> 42:09.486
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

42:11.426 --> 42:16.326
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

42:18.856 --> 42:25.096
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

42:25.386 --> 42:31.616
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

42:33.666 --> 42:40.105
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

42:40.106 --> 42:46.896
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

